WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.120
|||||\\\\\\\\\\\\\

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:43.020
Alchemy

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:43.020
Shower

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:37.940
Poor child

00:01:38.740 --> 00:01:41.030
Here, eat a little

00:01:41.110 --> 00:01:42.280
Baby

00:01:44.870 --> 00:01:45.950
eat

00:01:50.330 --> 00:01:51.870
I'll bring you some more meat

00:01:52.460 --> 00:01:53.880
Chew slowly

00:02:34.460 --> 00:02:35.460
Mom

00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:49.140
Project coordinator and editor: Ria_Lee

00:02:49.140 --> 00:02:51.140
Assistant coordinators: Sana, Martini

00:02:51.140 --> 00:02:53.140
Typesetter translators: Ria_Lee, tommo

00:03:28.350 --> 00:03:29.430
Gon!

00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:35.980
I asked you to let me know if something happens to him.

00:03:36.060 --> 00:03:37.810
How could you let this happen?

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:40.440
He comes to his senses, saturated with human energy

00:03:40.520 --> 00:03:42.030
Becoming normal again

00:03:42.110 --> 00:03:43.990
Your son has gone wild

00:03:47.820 --> 00:03:49.320
I'll take his soul

00:03:50.280 --> 00:03:51.990
I won't allow it!

00:03:52.080 --> 00:03:54.540
It was you who turned my son into a soul swallower!

00:03:54.620 --> 00:03:56.790
Get him a new body

00:03:56.870 --> 00:03:59.130
or feed with human souls!

00:03:59.880 --> 00:04:01.170
Bring back my son!

00:04:01.710 --> 00:04:03.420
Give it back to me!

00:04:04.090 --> 00:04:06.170
If it comes out that I
used forbidden magic

00:04:07.180 --> 00:04:08.760
the end for both of us

00:04:09.390 --> 00:04:11.010
No...

00:04:11.100 --> 00:04:11.930
Please...

00:04:16.310 --> 00:04:18.690
No please! Gon!

00:04:19.560 --> 00:04:22.190
Stay with me a little longer

00:04:22.820 --> 00:04:23.940
Son...

00:05:36.430 --> 00:05:39.980
Why do Soulswallowers' bodies turn to stone when they go wild?

00:05:40.060 --> 00:05:43.360
Cracks form when absorbed souls conflict with the body

00:05:44.440 --> 00:05:46.480
This leads to loss of energy

00:05:47.070 --> 00:05:49.740
This is already the eighth feral

00:05:50.280 --> 00:05:52.700
Apparently it's time to stop this

00:05:53.320 --> 00:05:55.120
You must go to the palace

00:05:56.370 --> 00:05:59.910
His Majesty is interested in a new spell,

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:01.670
which you were trying to master

00:06:36.580 --> 00:06:37.660
I heard...

00:06:38.700 --> 00:06:41.540
you are learning a new spell

00:06:42.040 --> 00:06:45.710
Nothing significant. Yes, just for fun

00:06:46.330 --> 00:06:49.590
I know I can't ask to live longer

00:06:49.670 --> 00:06:50.840
Only now...

00:06:50.920 --> 00:06:54.090
It upsets me that I don’t have an heir

00:06:54.930 --> 00:06:56.930
I wish you a speedy recovery

00:06:57.720 --> 00:07:00.220
This weak body is not capable of anything

00:07:01.020 --> 00:07:03.190
I'd have a chance

00:07:04.270 --> 00:07:07.940
May my body be healthy and young

00:07:09.900 --> 00:07:12.860
Body swap is not possible

00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:18.410
But you can

00:07:22.540 --> 00:07:23.660
Alchemy of Souls

00:07:32.130 --> 00:07:34.010
This is forbidden magic

00:07:34.090 --> 00:07:37.390
If the body and soul do not merge, you can turn into an evil spirit

00:07:37.470 --> 00:07:39.050
How dare I

00:07:39.140 --> 00:07:41.680
transfer the king's soul into someone else's body?

00:07:41.770 --> 00:07:44.180
What about your body?

00:07:47.350 --> 00:07:49.360
Just for seven days

00:07:49.900 --> 00:07:51.820
Let's switch bodies for a week

00:07:54.990 --> 00:07:58.070
I heard you transferred a soul into a dead man's body

00:07:58.870 --> 00:08:01.490
And this soul lived in the new body for six months

00:08:02.700 --> 00:08:06.870
I am a king, heaven protects me. And you are the best magician in the country

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:08.460
So why worry?

00:08:09.670 --> 00:08:13.050
And in a week you will return everything as it was

00:08:16.340 --> 00:08:19.300
You can do what they can

00:08:19.390 --> 00:08:20.890
only the strongest

00:08:22.180 --> 00:08:24.020
Now you're wasting your time

00:08:24.100 --> 00:08:26.060
moving souls into dead bodies

00:08:30.980 --> 00:08:32.110
Chang Gan,

00:08:32.820 --> 00:08:34.530
give the king a new body

00:11:15.440 --> 00:11:18.020
The king and I swapped bodies

00:11:26.740 --> 00:11:28.990
I have to make Do Hwa mine

00:11:29.080 --> 00:11:31.580
If she gets pregnant, then the child is mine

00:11:34.080 --> 00:11:35.330
Do Hwa...

00:11:39.750 --> 00:11:40.880
Do Hwa,

00:11:42.210 --> 00:11:43.840
you are very beautiful

00:11:54.980 --> 00:11:57.520
No, this cannot be allowed

00:12:02.070 --> 00:12:04.900
This cannot be allowed!

00:12:05.570 --> 00:12:06.780
No!

00:12:29.090 --> 00:12:32.180
The power of heaven moved the wind, clouds and rain

00:12:32.680 --> 00:12:34.310
Having reached the ground, this force

00:12:35.890 --> 00:12:38.100
created enormous energy

00:12:38.190 --> 00:12:40.560
An entire country was built on Lake Gyeongcheongdaeho

00:12:40.650 --> 00:12:42.610
On the lake that personified this energy

00:12:42.690 --> 00:12:46.320
The country was called Deho, in honor of the lake on which it stands

00:12:48.400 --> 00:12:51.660
People who could control this energy

00:12:51.740 --> 00:12:53.410
called magicians

00:12:55.370 --> 00:12:58.500
This story is about the magicians of Daeho, a place that doesn't exist.

00:12:58.580 --> 00:13:00.540
neither in textbooks nor on maps

00:13:16.430 --> 00:13:20.190
20 years later

00:13:29.610 --> 00:13:31.030
So you are Nak Soo,

00:13:31.110 --> 00:13:33.120
a warrior who prowls the city

00:13:33.740 --> 00:13:35.160
and kills magicians

00:13:35.240 --> 00:13:36.830
My name is Nak Soo because

00:13:36.910 --> 00:13:39.210
that where I won't go,

00:13:39.290 --> 00:13:40.460
heads fly off shoulders*

00:13:39.290 --> 00:13:40.460
*her name is consonant with the expression

00:13:41.210 --> 00:13:42.920
Great name, right?

00:13:44.130 --> 00:13:45.170
Kill her

00:13:47.630 --> 00:13:48.510
Shoot!

00:16:46.810 --> 00:16:48.270
Don't let her go

00:16:48.940 --> 00:16:50.440
- Catch her
- Yes!

00:17:03.330 --> 00:17:05.040
There. Follow me

00:17:15.590 --> 00:17:16.840
Over there!

00:18:06.930 --> 00:18:08.310
I won't die here

00:18:09.140 --> 00:18:10.350
I can't

00:18:19.190 --> 00:18:23.280
How impatient. Yes I go

00:18:39.380 --> 00:18:40.630
What do you want?

00:18:43.720 --> 00:18:45.890
Heaven!

00:19:10.580 --> 00:19:11.870
inn

00:19:19.460 --> 00:19:20.630
Dead

00:19:41.980 --> 00:19:43.690
There is no blue mark on it

00:19:47.490 --> 00:19:50.080
The mark proves that her soul has moved to another body

00:19:51.490 --> 00:19:52.950
It turns out she couldn't

00:19:54.120 --> 00:19:55.500
merge with another body?

00:20:24.400 --> 00:20:29.240
Sosnovy Bor

00:20:32.700 --> 00:20:33.620
Time

00:20:36.040 --> 00:20:36.870
Two

00:20:38.670 --> 00:20:39.710
Three

00:20:59.060 --> 00:21:01.610
Yul, come over

00:21:05.820 --> 00:21:07.360
Is this Nak Soo?

00:21:08.200 --> 00:21:09.160
Yes

00:21:10.570 --> 00:21:13.700
This mark indicates that the soul has left the body

00:21:14.290 --> 00:21:17.160
Remember it. If someone switches bodies,

00:21:17.250 --> 00:21:20.960
there is this bruise right above the heart

00:21:22.080 --> 00:21:24.960
So her soul escaped?

00:21:25.050 --> 00:21:28.550
Apparently she tried, but couldn't

00:21:29.300 --> 00:21:31.510
This means that her soul has left her,

00:21:31.590 --> 00:21:35.430
but we found no evidence that she had moved to another body

00:21:45.570 --> 00:21:47.940
- This is a whistle
- Whistle?

00:21:48.030 --> 00:21:50.910
I had the same one when I kept a bird at home

00:21:52.870 --> 00:21:55.280
Did she have a bird?

00:21:55.370 --> 00:21:57.370
I think I was for a while

00:21:58.160 --> 00:21:59.960
He seems important to her

00:22:00.790 --> 00:22:03.920
She's a warrior who's killed people left and right

00:22:04.000 --> 00:22:08.380
but she is still a person. She probably had her own story.

00:22:16.310 --> 00:22:18.890
A lot of people saw Nak Soo's body

00:22:18.980 --> 00:22:21.190
Rumors are flying about the alchemy of souls

00:22:21.850 --> 00:22:24.860
20 years have passed since we saw the last nomad

00:22:25.400 --> 00:22:26.400
Yes

00:22:27.480 --> 00:22:30.900
He turned into a soul swallower and killed many people

00:22:31.900 --> 00:22:35.240
I'm afraid it might happen again

00:22:35.830 --> 00:22:38.200
Uncle!

00:22:40.040 --> 00:22:42.790
Uncle, I heard Nak Soo was a nomad

00:22:43.370 --> 00:22:45.290
Master Huo, have you seen her too?

00:22:45.380 --> 00:22:48.840
Are you quite concerned about rumors?

00:22:48.920 --> 00:22:51.590
Rumors have already spread. I came running as soon as I heard

00:22:52.220 --> 00:22:54.050
-Where did you hear that?
- To Chwiseonru

00:22:54.140 --> 00:22:55.850
You could Jeongjingak

00:22:55.930 --> 00:22:59.720
And instead of studying, you ran to the poets to pick up rumors

00:23:01.270 --> 00:23:05.770
In the Chonjingak Pine Forest, not only are spells cast,

00:23:05.860 --> 00:23:07.730
but they also collect information

00:23:08.770 --> 00:23:11.150
And our Dan Gu will go

00:23:11.240 --> 00:23:13.400
in your footsteps

00:23:13.490 --> 00:23:15.570
and will become the head of Sosnovy Bor

00:23:15.660 --> 00:23:17.490
He must be able to drink

00:23:17.580 --> 00:23:18.620
Now tell me

00:23:19.330 --> 00:23:21.620
What's the best thing to drink in Jwiseonru?

00:23:22.580 --> 00:23:25.540
I don't go there so often now because Uka isn't here

00:23:25.620 --> 00:23:27.630
Uk? Chang Gan's son?

00:23:27.710 --> 00:23:32.090
Isn’t he studying writing at Yeongchundane Village School?

00:23:32.170 --> 00:23:34.260
He was kicked out of there a long time ago

00:23:34.340 --> 00:23:36.260
Now he is in Kisan

00:23:36.340 --> 00:23:40.060
I sent him to study with the Buddhist monk Ho Young

00:23:41.520 --> 00:23:45.230
Wook went to the Buddhist temple at such and such a time?

00:23:46.850 --> 00:23:49.690
Today I graduate

00:23:51.190 --> 00:23:53.860
But you haven't mastered everything

00:23:53.940 --> 00:23:57.070
How dare you do it without my permission?!

00:23:57.160 --> 00:23:58.530
You asked to expand my knowledge,

00:23:58.620 --> 00:24:01.450
so I read and memorized hundreds of spell books

00:24:01.540 --> 00:24:03.290
You asked to train the mind,

00:24:03.370 --> 00:24:05.920
so I patiently sharpened hundreds of swords

00:24:06.000 --> 00:24:09.920
Only you haven't taught me a single spell.

00:24:10.540 --> 00:24:12.880
The only thing I learned here is

00:24:12.960 --> 00:24:17.470
you are not going to teach me spells

00:24:18.050 --> 00:24:20.510
And now, having learned this lesson,

00:24:20.600 --> 00:24:22.260
I want to leave this place

00:24:22.770 --> 00:24:25.980
The head of Sosnovy Bor said to keep you here for three years.

00:24:26.060 --> 00:24:29.360
I know that you are building a temple with the money that I paid you

00:24:29.440 --> 00:24:32.320
I will not ask for compensation, I hope the temple will be completed

00:24:34.240 --> 00:24:37.450
Where are you going? I didn't allow you to leave

00:24:39.320 --> 00:24:42.740
Where did you get the idea that I asked permission?

00:24:45.330 --> 00:24:47.410
Conceived due to the mother's accidental relationship,

00:24:47.500 --> 00:24:49.170
abandoned by his own father,

00:24:49.250 --> 00:24:51.750
what do you know about respect for a master?

00:24:51.840 --> 00:24:54.590
I refuse to teach someone like you

00:24:55.630 --> 00:24:57.800
I'm not a respectable student,

00:24:57.880 --> 00:24:59.510
but I know how to collect debts

00:24:59.590 --> 00:25:01.180
One more word

00:25:01.260 --> 00:25:03.470
and you will never finish the temple

00:25:05.100 --> 00:25:06.890
I will demand my money back

00:25:07.600 --> 00:25:12.360
No one in the world will teach you spells because of your father.

00:25:12.440 --> 00:25:14.980
Well, thank you for your concern

00:25:16.030 --> 00:25:19.530
I will find my master

00:25:20.280 --> 00:25:23.410
Someone incredibly strong and skilled

00:25:40.680 --> 00:25:42.340
Moo Deok, are you okay?

00:26:43.240 --> 00:26:46.160
Why did I end up in such a body?

00:26:49.160 --> 00:26:51.370
I'm sure she was blind

00:26:56.500 --> 00:26:58.300
But what is it I see?

00:26:58.960 --> 00:27:00.670
Because the soul is different?

00:27:03.470 --> 00:27:06.260
She doesn't even have a blue mark.

00:27:06.350 --> 00:27:07.760
How unusual

00:27:08.850 --> 00:27:11.890
Be patient, Moo Deok. Soon you won't feel motion sick, you're almost there

00:27:14.440 --> 00:27:15.400
"Moo Dok"

00:27:15.480 --> 00:27:18.980
This is a blind girl from the village who was sold to the fort.

00:27:22.530 --> 00:27:23.900
Sit down, you'll fall

00:27:34.870 --> 00:27:36.330
Thanks for the trip

00:27:37.210 --> 00:27:38.210
I'll get off here

00:27:50.640 --> 00:27:51.930
What's wrong with me?

00:27:52.470 --> 00:27:53.850
Strength gone

00:27:54.600 --> 00:27:57.020
This body can’t even get up here?

00:27:59.110 --> 00:28:00.270
Hands are so weak

00:28:01.190 --> 00:28:02.440
Ahjusshi!

00:28:03.030 --> 00:28:04.650
- Help!
- What...

00:28:04.740 --> 00:28:06.490
- Ahjusshi
- Saints...

00:28:06.570 --> 00:28:07.910
Moo Deok, hold on

00:28:07.990 --> 00:28:08.870
Ahjusshi!

00:28:08.950 --> 00:28:11.620
Turn the boat around. Back!

00:28:11.700 --> 00:28:13.290
- Heaven...
- Moo Dok!

00:28:13.370 --> 00:28:14.460
I'll fall

00:28:14.540 --> 00:28:15.580
Ahjusshi!

00:28:27.470 --> 00:28:31.560
Why are you hanging there if you can’t even see?

00:28:31.640 --> 00:28:32.970
You could have gotten hurt

00:28:34.810 --> 00:28:36.270
Everything is very bad

00:28:36.350 --> 00:28:38.190
My strength has left me

00:28:43.690 --> 00:28:45.150
Are you feeling nauseous again?

00:28:45.820 --> 00:28:49.030
I'm so worried about your weakness

00:28:49.620 --> 00:28:51.080
Weakness

00:28:51.160 --> 00:28:53.540
This body is too weak and unhealthy

00:28:54.240 --> 00:28:57.370
You can't change bodies often. Let's stay a little Moo Deok

00:28:58.000 --> 00:29:00.290
Sorry, ahjusshi

00:29:00.380 --> 00:29:01.630
Nothing

00:29:01.710 --> 00:29:03.380
All because of a weak body

00:29:04.130 --> 00:29:05.300
Let's eat

00:29:18.140 --> 00:29:18.980
- Your food
- Thank you

00:29:19.060 --> 00:29:20.810
Let's eat up today

00:29:20.900 --> 00:29:22.270
This is chicken. Eat

00:29:23.610 --> 00:29:26.110
Like a warrior, I'm sensitive to the smell of blood

00:29:26.190 --> 00:29:30.070
I do not eat meat from animals whose blood is the same color as humans.

00:29:30.160 --> 00:29:31.820
- I don't want to
- Just eat

00:29:39.790 --> 00:29:42.420
For the first time... eating meat

00:29:43.750 --> 00:29:44.920
Delicious

00:29:49.680 --> 00:29:50.760
You look

00:29:50.840 --> 00:29:54.470
I really don't want to send you there,

00:29:54.560 --> 00:29:57.350
but this is the only place where they agreed to accept a blind woman

00:29:59.770 --> 00:30:02.900
"There"? Where?

00:30:05.690 --> 00:30:08.820
One woman took her in after her parents died

00:30:08.900 --> 00:30:11.070
But she got sick and died

00:30:11.160 --> 00:30:13.660
Her debt was transferred to her due to illness,

00:30:13.740 --> 00:30:15.620
that's why it's sold here

00:30:15.700 --> 00:30:16.660
I'll go

00:30:17.660 --> 00:30:19.910
You can't sell this soul to the gisaeng house

00:30:20.000 --> 00:30:22.370
- Good luck
- But...

00:30:24.540 --> 00:30:27.500
I can't believe he fed me chicken so he could sell me here.

00:30:27.590 --> 00:30:30.720
I'll tear you into pieces as soon as I get my strength back

00:30:31.220 --> 00:30:33.300
Too skinny

00:30:33.390 --> 00:30:36.220
Maybe you'll become cuter if you plump up your cheeks

00:30:36.310 --> 00:30:38.720
Give it up. won't help me

00:30:39.310 --> 00:30:41.890
I'm useless and unfit to be a gisaeng

00:30:41.980 --> 00:30:43.350
Send me somewhere else

00:30:43.440 --> 00:30:45.560
And you speak beautifully

00:30:46.150 --> 00:30:47.320
I heard you still sing

00:30:47.400 --> 00:30:49.780
I hope it's as good as you say

00:30:52.530 --> 00:30:55.410
First wash and dress up

00:31:09.760 --> 00:31:11.510
Can you even dance?

00:31:12.090 --> 00:31:13.220
Was it like dancing?

00:31:14.130 --> 00:31:17.300
If I had the same strength, there would be nothing left of my hand.

00:31:20.520 --> 00:31:23.190
I'm older, so speak respectfully

00:31:23.270 --> 00:31:25.600
And with the guests too

00:31:25.690 --> 00:31:28.070
Wait. I'll kill you too

00:31:29.320 --> 00:31:33.150
Many influential people visit us

00:31:33.740 --> 00:31:36.910
Four seasons Daeho is also a regular at Jwiesongru

00:31:38.080 --> 00:31:39.200
Four of what?

00:31:39.280 --> 00:31:42.580
There are four types of beautiful people in Daeho

00:31:42.660 --> 00:31:44.750
They're called the Four Seasons

00:31:59.510 --> 00:32:02.810
Daughter of the Jin family who has the life force of spring

00:32:03.640 --> 00:32:04.560
Jin Cho Young

00:32:20.080 --> 00:32:22.950
The heir of the Park family, with the energy of hot summer

00:32:23.040 --> 00:32:24.290
Park Dak Gu

00:32:36.090 --> 00:32:39.430
The genius of the So family, as noble as the sunset in autumn

00:32:40.260 --> 00:32:41.260
Seo Yul

00:32:59.200 --> 00:33:03.240
And the last one is Chan Wook, the successor of the Chan family,

00:33:03.330 --> 00:33:06.830
as dazzling as snow in winter

00:33:14.550 --> 00:33:17.300
Jin, Park, Seo and Chan families

00:33:17.380 --> 00:33:20.390
The most famous magic families in Daeho

00:33:20.470 --> 00:33:22.470
Their children are called the Four Seasons

00:33:23.600 --> 00:33:26.220
That's what they call them in the city?

00:33:28.440 --> 00:33:31.400
My summer prince has arrived

00:33:36.280 --> 00:33:38.360
If he is the heir of the Park family,

00:33:38.950 --> 00:33:40.740
So he's Park Jin's nephew

00:33:43.370 --> 00:33:44.280
Park Jin

00:33:47.830 --> 00:33:50.290
He was there that night too

00:33:59.800 --> 00:34:00.840
Jin

00:34:01.800 --> 00:34:02.930
Co

00:34:03.640 --> 00:34:04.850
Chan

00:34:05.560 --> 00:34:06.770
Pak

00:34:16.110 --> 00:34:17.110
Four seasons

00:34:18.570 --> 00:34:22.360
When I reach you it will be the end

00:34:25.370 --> 00:34:27.870
Meet your death nobly

00:34:31.960 --> 00:34:34.630
Who do you want to meet today?

00:34:34.710 --> 00:34:38.550
Uncle said to bring someone

00:34:39.130 --> 00:34:41.300
Bring someone? Whom?

00:34:41.380 --> 00:34:44.010
Student in Kisan

00:34:44.090 --> 00:34:47.010
who humiliated the master and was exiled

00:34:48.140 --> 00:34:50.640
I'm sure he's hiding here

00:34:51.520 --> 00:34:53.150
You look

00:34:53.230 --> 00:34:56.480
Longing for seafood

00:34:56.570 --> 00:34:58.570
after life in the mountains

00:34:58.650 --> 00:35:00.530
I think he's there

00:35:22.550 --> 00:35:24.800
By your grace my uncle had to

00:35:24.890 --> 00:35:27.890
go all the way to Kisan to ask the monk for forgiveness

00:35:27.970 --> 00:35:32.730
And at this time you are eating crabs here

00:35:32.810 --> 00:35:34.480
No, I won't eat

00:35:34.560 --> 00:35:35.900
Too much trouble

00:35:36.480 --> 00:35:38.820
Glad you came. Break the shell with a spell

00:35:39.820 --> 00:35:41.070
I can't believe it

00:35:41.150 --> 00:35:45.110
I can break the shell and get the meat

00:35:45.200 --> 00:35:47.870
But instead of crab I want to try it on you

00:35:47.950 --> 00:35:51.370
Dan Gu, if only this monk would be so generous as to at least teach me this,

00:35:51.450 --> 00:35:53.460
I wouldn't leave like that

00:35:53.540 --> 00:35:55.210
What's the point if you can't?

00:35:55.290 --> 00:35:57.210
Your father forbade you to do magic

00:35:57.290 --> 00:35:58.880
Then he should help me with this

00:35:58.960 --> 00:36:02.460
This is what teachers do. They help students

00:36:02.550 --> 00:36:05.220
There is no one in Daeho so brave

00:36:05.300 --> 00:36:07.470
to go against your father

00:36:07.550 --> 00:36:09.140
But there are those who live without fear

00:36:09.220 --> 00:36:10.430
For example,

00:36:11.390 --> 00:36:13.310
that warrior Nak Su

00:36:17.690 --> 00:36:18.810
Don't be funny

00:36:18.900 --> 00:36:22.150
I heard that she is so strong that even the head is too strong

00:36:23.440 --> 00:36:24.780
She's dead

00:36:25.450 --> 00:36:28.280
Her soul left her body, which means she could be alive

00:36:29.780 --> 00:36:31.080
Who told you?

00:36:31.790 --> 00:36:34.370
Do you think I came here to eat crabs?

00:36:34.450 --> 00:36:35.710
It's fastest here

00:36:35.790 --> 00:36:37.960
you will find out the news of our country

00:36:38.500 --> 00:36:39.920
Get the meat already

00:36:40.000 --> 00:36:42.800
Use the spell to your advantage, get the meat

00:36:42.880 --> 00:36:46.130
But you can’t do it yourself, you lazy person?

00:36:49.640 --> 00:36:52.140
I took a bath and started to bloom

00:36:52.220 --> 00:36:53.390
Let me paint you

00:36:54.600 --> 00:36:57.100
Unnie, myself

00:36:57.190 --> 00:36:59.900
But how? You're blind

00:37:01.190 --> 00:37:03.110
I've never done this before

00:37:03.190 --> 00:37:05.280
I need to get ready

00:37:06.740 --> 00:37:08.820
I want to be alone for a while

00:37:10.780 --> 00:37:13.030
Certainly. Come out when you're ready

00:37:24.170 --> 00:37:26.420
Pretending to be blind makes it easier to fool people

00:37:27.590 --> 00:37:29.220
Need money to escape

00:37:31.760 --> 00:37:33.220
Is this real gold?

00:37:34.760 --> 00:37:36.270
This is jade

00:37:37.100 --> 00:37:40.190
Moo Deok, try this new blush

00:37:41.810 --> 00:37:42.690
What are you doing?

00:37:44.230 --> 00:37:46.570
Unnie, what is it?

00:37:49.450 --> 00:37:51.110
Do you see?

00:38:00.580 --> 00:38:03.000
Catch Moo Deok! Catch the thief!

00:38:08.800 --> 00:38:10.090
Too high

00:38:18.480 --> 00:38:19.350
There!

00:38:43.120 --> 00:38:44.580
Where are you looking?

00:39:02.390 --> 00:39:03.520
You...

00:39:11.440 --> 00:39:12.820
Not a sound

00:39:14.660 --> 00:39:17.530
Heard the blind girl arrived today

00:39:18.160 --> 00:39:19.200
Do you see

00:39:22.210 --> 00:39:23.960
They told me your name

00:39:24.040 --> 00:39:26.080
On "D" or something like that

00:39:26.170 --> 00:39:27.250
No

00:39:28.590 --> 00:39:29.800
I remembered

00:39:30.710 --> 00:39:31.590
Moo Deok

00:39:33.380 --> 00:39:35.680
Yes, I'm Moo Deok

00:39:36.550 --> 00:39:39.260
I know what you look like

00:39:39.350 --> 00:39:41.640
if you don't stay quiet until I leave,

00:39:41.730 --> 00:39:43.520
I'll come for you

00:39:47.440 --> 00:39:48.480
What's so funny?

00:39:50.480 --> 00:39:51.820
You have beautiful eyes

00:39:54.650 --> 00:39:55.660
Enough is enough

00:39:56.780 --> 00:39:59.780
Yes, sorry. Only the eyes are beautiful

00:40:01.750 --> 00:40:02.870
idiot

00:40:09.840 --> 00:40:10.670
Moo Deok

00:40:11.380 --> 00:40:12.670
Moo Dok!

00:40:14.300 --> 00:40:16.890
Oh, that's a small thing

00:40:18.850 --> 00:40:20.010
Just

00:40:21.060 --> 00:40:22.020
take this

00:40:25.440 --> 00:40:26.520
Hey...

00:40:45.620 --> 00:40:48.460
- What's there?
- Nothing

00:40:53.840 --> 00:40:54.800
Dan Gu,

00:40:56.380 --> 00:40:59.260
I heard Nak Soo uses Tansu

00:40:59.340 --> 00:41:01.260
What do you know about Tansu?

00:41:01.350 --> 00:41:03.850
Enough. Read in my free time

00:41:04.350 --> 00:41:05.270
Tansu

00:41:05.980 --> 00:41:07.690
You see, Tansu

00:41:07.770 --> 00:41:11.110
the art of swordsmanship, which only the best magicians can master

00:41:11.190 --> 00:41:13.980
You hit the blade with energy, as if pouring water

00:41:14.070 --> 00:41:16.530
One hit is enough to kill

00:41:26.290 --> 00:41:28.620
Why are you asking?

00:41:29.290 --> 00:41:32.750
Just wondering if this crab could have killed me

00:41:32.840 --> 00:41:35.670
Come here. Give it to me, I'll get the meat...

00:41:37.220 --> 00:41:40.340
Uk, this is a vital point

00:41:41.930 --> 00:41:43.180
I might die

00:41:43.260 --> 00:41:45.430
Yes. She also aimed at this point

00:41:48.560 --> 00:41:51.560
But why did she retreat then?

00:41:57.190 --> 00:42:00.570
Why is this weak body always hungry?

00:42:00.660 --> 00:42:02.910
If I don't eat, I'll become weaker

00:42:03.450 --> 00:42:04.780
There is no way out

00:42:15.460 --> 00:42:17.760
Now you can't fight, you have to hold back

00:42:23.510 --> 00:42:25.140
The Magi of Jeonjingak are here

00:42:30.560 --> 00:42:32.900
I heard the killer entered Jeonjingak in Sosnovy Bor

00:42:32.980 --> 00:42:35.060
What fool would dare to enter Jeongjingak?

00:42:35.150 --> 00:42:37.360
She attacked the head, but she was caught

00:42:37.440 --> 00:42:38.900
It was a young girl

00:43:12.190 --> 00:43:14.600
He should have seen my dead body

00:43:14.690 --> 00:43:16.150
Most likely he didn't recognize me

00:43:17.270 --> 00:43:20.900
I'm sure he didn't recognize the whistle either.

00:43:30.290 --> 00:43:33.000
There are no traces of Nak Su here either.

00:43:33.710 --> 00:43:36.500
I guess she couldn't find a new body

00:43:37.590 --> 00:43:40.340
Even if she succeeds, she's probably hiding

00:43:40.420 --> 00:43:42.720
because I ran into a problem

00:43:42.800 --> 00:43:45.590
The warrior who revealed himself must be destroyed

00:43:48.050 --> 00:43:50.010
We will need to steal her body and sword

00:43:50.100 --> 00:43:52.350
Get rid of all traces of her

00:43:52.430 --> 00:43:56.400
What if she's still alive?

00:43:57.980 --> 00:44:00.360
Or she will be killed for changing her body,

00:44:00.440 --> 00:44:02.690
or her soul will not get along with the new body,

00:44:02.780 --> 00:44:04.400
and turn to stone

00:44:04.990 --> 00:44:07.450
I raised her to be the best mercenary

00:44:08.320 --> 00:44:09.580
What a pity

00:44:17.960 --> 00:44:19.540
How much longer will you look?

00:44:19.630 --> 00:44:23.590
Dear little thing, you need to take a closer look

00:44:23.670 --> 00:44:26.970
I'm not asking for much. Name your price and pay

00:44:29.350 --> 00:44:30.220
Here!

00:44:31.140 --> 00:44:32.720
- Here she is
- What is it?

00:44:32.810 --> 00:44:33.930
Take her away

00:44:49.570 --> 00:44:52.080
Where am I? Have I been caught?

00:44:53.290 --> 00:44:54.830
Then this is Sosnovy Bor?

00:44:58.040 --> 00:44:59.420
Are you awake?

00:44:59.500 --> 00:45:01.840
Who are you? Where am I?

00:45:05.880 --> 00:45:08.800
This is the house of Mr. Chang Gan, the head of Jeonbugwan.

00:45:09.390 --> 00:45:12.560
Chang Gang? So this is the Chan family's house?

00:45:16.980 --> 00:45:21.440
Why did the young master take it into his head to bring you here?

00:45:21.520 --> 00:45:24.030
- Master?
- Yes

00:45:24.110 --> 00:45:27.900
Mr. Chan Wook bought you out of the gisaeng house

00:45:27.990 --> 00:45:31.530
I heard you stole his amber amulet

00:45:33.530 --> 00:45:34.830
Just take it

00:45:36.870 --> 00:45:38.080
Hey...

00:45:39.000 --> 00:45:40.750
Why did he bring me here?

00:45:40.830 --> 00:45:43.750
I got scared when he said he was bringing home a girl

00:45:44.380 --> 00:45:46.170
but when I saw you, I calmed down

00:45:46.260 --> 00:45:47.920
He helped you out of pity

00:45:48.720 --> 00:45:51.010
Here, change your clothes

00:45:51.090 --> 00:45:52.300
Moo Deok

00:45:52.390 --> 00:45:54.390
- What is this?
- What do you think?

00:45:54.470 --> 00:45:56.270
Master's maid outfit

00:45:56.350 --> 00:46:00.390
Besides, you have to address me with respect.

00:46:01.980 --> 00:46:03.560
The young master is weak

00:46:03.650 --> 00:46:05.530
he gets tired quickly

00:46:05.610 --> 00:46:07.860
Do everything quickly as soon as he asks

00:46:08.440 --> 00:46:12.070
And always smile no matter what

00:46:13.280 --> 00:46:14.370
Will you answer?

00:46:15.540 --> 00:46:17.620
- Yes
- Okay

00:46:18.200 --> 00:46:21.620
He wanted to see you as soon as possible, change your clothes and go to him

00:46:21.710 --> 00:46:22.790
I can't hear

00:46:23.500 --> 00:46:24.630
Yes...

00:46:25.800 --> 00:46:26.630
unnie

00:46:28.340 --> 00:46:30.220
Call me mistress

00:46:34.550 --> 00:46:35.720
The owner?

00:46:36.930 --> 00:46:38.600
Why did he bring me here?

00:46:41.810 --> 00:46:43.190
You have beautiful eyes

00:46:44.270 --> 00:46:45.650
Fell in love?

00:46:47.110 --> 00:46:48.530
In this face?

00:46:50.190 --> 00:46:51.820
He has bad taste

00:46:59.500 --> 00:47:01.710
It will be safer for me anyway

00:47:01.790 --> 00:47:04.210
live here until I recover

00:47:05.670 --> 00:47:09.710
If he fell in love with me, he will treat me well

00:47:10.880 --> 00:47:12.470
Then...

00:47:12.550 --> 00:47:16.350
I guess I'll have to live here as Moo Deok

00:47:17.720 --> 00:47:20.640
Master, it's me, Moo Deok

00:47:21.600 --> 00:47:22.730
Come in

00:47:33.780 --> 00:47:34.700
Owner

00:47:34.780 --> 00:47:36.820
Thank you very much for saving me

00:47:36.910 --> 00:47:39.330
and brought here

00:47:40.370 --> 00:47:42.460
It only took a couple of people to bring you here.

00:47:44.170 --> 00:47:46.880
- I'm disappointed
- I know it was rude of me

00:47:46.960 --> 00:47:51.010
threaten you with a crab leg, but I hope you forget about it

00:47:51.090 --> 00:47:52.590
You're much more polite now

00:47:52.670 --> 00:47:54.720
I will serve you well

00:47:55.430 --> 00:47:56.930
Great, try your best

00:47:57.010 --> 00:47:59.390
Moo Deok, bring me some water

00:48:00.140 --> 00:48:01.310
Yes, master

00:48:08.560 --> 00:48:09.400
Holy heavens

00:48:10.020 --> 00:48:11.900
I don't want to drink, but to wash myself

00:48:12.650 --> 00:48:14.740
Ah, I understand you, master

00:48:19.280 --> 00:48:21.540
I decided I'd better take a bath

00:48:28.250 --> 00:48:29.630
Oh, it's hot

00:48:29.710 --> 00:48:31.670
Too hot

00:48:33.340 --> 00:48:34.760
Yes, master

00:48:41.060 --> 00:48:42.560
And now it's cold

00:48:43.140 --> 00:48:45.020
The water is icy

00:48:48.020 --> 00:48:49.190
Not at all

00:48:49.270 --> 00:48:51.650
Icy. I will get sick if I wash in cold water

00:48:53.480 --> 00:48:55.280
- It's so cold

00:48:53.480 --> 00:48:55.280
- What's wrong with him?

00:48:55.360 --> 00:48:56.530
Didn't he fall in love with me?

00:48:56.610 --> 00:48:58.070
Why are you frozen, Moo Deok?

00:48:59.280 --> 00:49:02.490
Yes, master. I'll get some more hot water

00:49:08.330 --> 00:49:09.170
Salty

00:49:10.040 --> 00:49:11.040
Sweet. Spicy

00:49:11.130 --> 00:49:12.670
Long. What kind of taste is this?

00:49:12.750 --> 00:49:14.010
I won't eat this

00:49:17.470 --> 00:49:19.180
The water has a strange smell

00:49:19.890 --> 00:49:20.800
Smell?

00:49:21.800 --> 00:49:23.100
Bring another bucket

00:49:26.180 --> 00:49:27.100
Bring a new blanket

00:49:28.060 --> 00:49:30.350
Today I want to cover myself in blue

00:49:52.710 --> 00:49:56.590
He does nothing but bathe three times a day

00:50:00.510 --> 00:50:01.680
I'll kill him

00:50:01.760 --> 00:50:05.390
As soon as my strength returns, I will kill him first.

00:50:09.560 --> 00:50:12.360
Master, I brought cold water

00:50:13.060 --> 00:50:15.480
- I brought...
- Forget it, the water has cooled down

00:50:15.570 --> 00:50:17.030
to the desired temperature

00:50:18.490 --> 00:50:19.570
Well done...

00:50:19.650 --> 00:50:22.030
Oh, no. I tried in vain, Moo Deok

00:50:33.210 --> 00:50:34.630
If only I had the strength...

00:50:35.420 --> 00:50:38.670
At least a grain of the former strength...

00:50:50.810 --> 00:50:52.020
What's going on?

00:50:52.730 --> 00:50:55.980
What's happened?

00:51:13.000 --> 00:51:14.170
Are you having fun?

00:51:15.580 --> 00:51:16.500
What?

00:51:17.550 --> 00:51:19.170
Why are you smiling?

00:51:20.170 --> 00:51:21.260
Just like that

00:51:21.340 --> 00:51:22.930
The water is nice

00:51:23.880 --> 00:51:25.180
My things

00:51:25.260 --> 00:51:26.510
Yes, master

00:51:35.440 --> 00:51:36.270
Why did you get up?

00:51:37.980 --> 00:51:39.320
Your things

00:51:41.690 --> 00:51:43.650
You can go rest

00:51:44.320 --> 00:51:45.570
Yes, master

00:51:57.330 --> 00:52:01.420
This amulet will allow me to destroy the barrier and get into Sosnovy Bor

00:52:03.340 --> 00:52:04.970
But now I can't do it

00:52:05.050 --> 00:52:07.140
no strength to cast a spell

00:52:08.760 --> 00:52:10.010
I need to find my sword

00:52:11.560 --> 00:52:14.480
Maybe my power will return if I find him

00:52:17.940 --> 00:52:19.400
With this amulet

00:52:20.320 --> 00:52:22.780
I can get to Sosnovy Bor

00:52:26.950 --> 00:52:30.780
Sosnovy Bor

00:52:31.950 --> 00:52:35.210
How long do you plan to keep Nak Soo's body in Jeongjingak?

00:52:35.870 --> 00:52:37.960
If she can find a new body,

00:52:38.500 --> 00:52:39.590
Nak Su...

00:52:40.590 --> 00:52:42.000
will come back for the sword

00:52:43.760 --> 00:52:47.010
She will come here for her body

00:52:48.340 --> 00:52:50.430
Let's see how things turn out

00:52:57.100 --> 00:53:00.230
Your father's room is always empty

00:53:01.070 --> 00:53:02.690
but it's never dusty here

00:53:03.780 --> 00:53:05.570
I wonder when he'll be back

00:53:09.530 --> 00:53:12.990
Your mother's portrait began to fade

00:53:13.620 --> 00:53:16.080
Need to call an artist to restore it

00:53:38.770 --> 00:53:41.230
I learned all the books you told me to read

00:53:41.810 --> 00:53:43.860
Now teach me how to cast a spell,

00:53:43.940 --> 00:53:46.030
as Yulia and Dan Gu taught

00:53:54.620 --> 00:53:57.330
This sword belongs to your father

00:53:57.410 --> 00:53:58.710
Take it

00:54:11.840 --> 00:54:13.930
There's a spell cast on me

00:54:14.010 --> 00:54:16.520
because of which I cannot take the enchanted sword

00:54:17.020 --> 00:54:19.270
You can't even pick up your father's sword?

00:54:19.350 --> 00:54:21.020
How do you want to learn spells?

00:54:21.100 --> 00:54:23.980
Why can't you open the gate of my energy so that I can practice?

00:54:24.060 --> 00:54:24.980
I...

00:54:26.190 --> 00:54:27.570
I can't do this

00:54:28.940 --> 00:54:32.360
Then find me another teacher

00:54:33.070 --> 00:54:34.490
No one can do this

00:54:35.410 --> 00:54:37.870
No one in Daeho can stand up to your father.

00:54:37.950 --> 00:54:39.870
and open the gates of your energy

00:54:39.960 --> 00:54:41.420
So what you're saying is

00:54:42.370 --> 00:54:44.250
I'll never be able to master spells?

00:54:44.340 --> 00:54:45.290
It's fate

00:54:45.380 --> 00:54:49.550
which your father gave you

00:54:50.510 --> 00:54:52.380
Why?!

00:54:52.470 --> 00:54:54.390
Why does he control my destiny?

00:54:55.640 --> 00:54:58.020
Nobody thinks he's my real father anyway.

00:54:59.560 --> 00:55:01.020
I'll find someone

00:55:02.100 --> 00:55:06.110
A teacher who will reveal my powers and teach me magic

00:55:06.940 --> 00:55:08.730
I'll find him myself

00:55:10.110 --> 00:55:12.490
And then I'll take out this sword and split it in two

00:55:38.720 --> 00:55:41.180
I heard Mr. Chan was expelled again

00:55:41.850 --> 00:55:45.060
Why does Great Master Chan's son always get into trouble?

00:55:45.150 --> 00:55:46.860
Because he's not his son

00:55:46.940 --> 00:55:49.270
Do Hwa, the most beautiful woman in Daeho,

00:55:49.360 --> 00:55:51.740
cheated on him with another man and gave birth to Chan Wook

00:55:52.320 --> 00:55:53.950
I doubt this is true

00:55:54.030 --> 00:55:57.120
Then why did he deprive his son of the ability to use magic?

00:55:57.200 --> 00:55:59.120
and condemned to the life of a slacker?

00:56:00.120 --> 00:56:04.160
I wonder if he is really so weak because of his father's spell?

00:56:13.880 --> 00:56:15.840
The amulet must be here somewhere

00:56:30.150 --> 00:56:31.610
Where is he?

00:56:56.650 --> 00:56:58.480
Why did I hide here?

00:56:58.650 --> 00:57:01.110
What will he think of me?

00:57:01.650 --> 00:57:03.110
What should I tell him?

00:57:08.970 --> 00:57:11.640
That's not why I brought you here

00:57:13.640 --> 00:57:14.480
Master...

00:57:15.190 --> 00:57:17.770
you kept repeating that you were cold,

00:57:17.860 --> 00:57:19.900
so I decided to warm your bed

00:57:19.980 --> 00:57:22.860
If you lie down now, you will be warm all night

00:57:22.940 --> 00:57:24.110
How's that?

00:57:25.700 --> 00:57:26.860
Nice of you

00:57:31.290 --> 00:57:33.500
- Good night
-Where did you go?

00:57:35.660 --> 00:57:37.040
You came to warm me this night

00:57:38.790 --> 00:57:40.090
Do it this way

00:57:40.750 --> 00:57:41.880
to my bed

00:57:43.210 --> 00:57:44.340
was warm all night

00:57:46.430 --> 00:57:47.590
Warm her up

00:57:51.850 --> 00:57:55.020
What? Does he really like me?

00:57:55.100 --> 00:57:56.690
Did I fall for his tricks?

00:58:05.070 --> 00:58:05.950
owner,

00:58:06.900 --> 00:58:09.490
my body heat is not enough to warm you

00:58:09.570 --> 00:58:11.580
Since childhood I have been constantly cold,

00:58:11.660 --> 00:58:14.410
that's why my body temperature is low

00:58:21.420 --> 00:58:22.630
Like this

00:58:36.270 --> 00:58:39.310
I'm not going to do what you want me to do

00:58:49.150 --> 00:58:51.530
Move the brazier closer

00:58:55.410 --> 00:58:56.580
A brazier?

00:58:57.160 --> 00:59:00.210
I just wanted you to put the brazier closer to the bed.

00:59:00.290 --> 00:59:01.380
and kept the fire going there

00:59:05.710 --> 00:59:07.170
Don't let it go out

00:59:13.800 --> 00:59:14.680
Here

00:59:15.260 --> 00:59:17.140
Too close

00:59:18.480 --> 00:59:19.940
It's going to be hot

00:59:20.810 --> 00:59:22.810
Yes, exactly. Too hot

00:59:26.780 --> 00:59:28.650
I'll sell you if the fire goes out

00:59:28.740 --> 00:59:30.360
Keep it up all night

00:59:30.450 --> 00:59:31.570
Yes

00:59:43.460 --> 00:59:46.800
And here comes Dan Gu

00:59:50.300 --> 00:59:52.510
What is this? Whistle

00:59:53.260 --> 00:59:54.090
Yes

00:59:55.050 --> 00:59:56.720
I'm sure I made it

00:59:56.810 --> 01:00:00.020
Oh, exactly. I remembered. You had a bird

01:00:00.100 --> 01:00:01.940
Are you going to have another one?

01:00:03.270 --> 01:00:04.480
No, that's not the point

01:00:04.560 --> 01:00:06.480
I found it in an unexpected place

01:00:07.650 --> 01:00:09.900
I wonder why she had it?

01:00:09.990 --> 01:00:11.200
Maybe you gave it to her yourself

01:00:11.780 --> 01:00:13.860
You could just forget about it

01:00:13.950 --> 01:00:15.030
No

01:00:15.910 --> 01:00:18.200
I clearly remember who I gave it to

01:00:35.300 --> 01:00:38.100
Then ask her

01:00:44.940 --> 01:00:47.690
Are you going to see her at this hour?

01:00:47.770 --> 01:00:49.190
Need to check something

01:02:44.430 --> 01:02:45.890
Who are these people?

01:03:01.620 --> 01:03:02.870
Invasion!

01:03:03.580 --> 01:03:05.290
We're under attack!

01:03:05.370 --> 01:03:06.660
Criminals

01:04:05.140 --> 01:04:06.390
We're leaving

01:04:37.420 --> 01:04:38.460
Out of the way!

01:05:19.000 --> 01:05:21.590
Yul, what's going on?

01:05:25.180 --> 01:05:26.640
The practice hall is on fire

01:05:34.600 --> 01:05:36.310
Who's in Jeongjingak now?

01:05:36.400 --> 01:05:37.900
Master Yul and Dan Gu

01:05:41.110 --> 01:05:42.480
Uncle, are you okay?

01:05:43.690 --> 01:05:44.900
The attackers escaped

01:05:47.070 --> 01:05:48.780
Jeongjingak is empty

01:05:59.540 --> 01:06:00.960
- Find them
- Yes

01:06:11.430 --> 01:06:13.060
Who were they?

01:06:14.060 --> 01:06:15.980
Did Dan Zhu send them?

01:06:19.060 --> 01:06:22.440
This time you must bring the soul of Pak Jin, the head of Sosnovy Bor

01:06:26.240 --> 01:06:27.360
Yes

01:06:28.450 --> 01:06:30.660
He must have sent them to get my body back.

01:06:38.540 --> 01:06:39.790
Who's here?

01:07:12.990 --> 01:07:13.870
Master?

01:07:28.090 --> 01:07:29.550
Why are you here?

01:07:32.970 --> 01:07:34.260
Because of your eyes

01:07:35.430 --> 01:07:36.310
Eye?

01:07:59.000 --> 01:08:00.620
I understood everything in our first meeting

01:08:03.290 --> 01:08:04.710
You are my teacher

01:08:48.460 --> 01:08:51.840
Nomad, mercenary warrior, Nak Su

01:08:51.920 --> 01:08:56.140
I was looking for a man who would break the spell and become my master

01:08:56.220 --> 01:08:57.760
I want you to become it

01:08:57.850 --> 01:08:59.470
What nonsense?

01:09:00.140 --> 01:09:02.930
They want to grab Nak Soo, she's in one of these people

01:09:03.020 --> 01:09:06.480
We will find this nomad

01:09:07.190 --> 01:09:08.690
If I get caught, pretend you don't know anything

01:09:10.480 --> 01:09:12.240
Stand next to me

01:09:12.320 --> 01:09:15.860
The people I met along the way only wanted me dead

01:09:17.160 --> 01:09:21.660
You are the first person who tried to save me

01:09:21.750 --> 01:09:24.000
If we meet face to face again,

01:09:24.080 --> 01:09:25.170
I'll leave you alive

01:10:13.430 --> 01:10:21.620
/////////////////////////////////////

01:10:13.430 --> 01:10:21.620
Thanks for watching with us!
your advertisement could be here

01:10:30.880 --> 01:10:33.950
Alchemy

01:10:30.880 --> 01:10:33.900
Shower
